      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "EmotionEffect": "EMARK",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그러니까, 부끄럽지 않아요!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "なので、恥ずかしくありません！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 74,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "강해지기 위해서니까! 강해져야 더 많은 사람을 도울 수 있으니까.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "強くなるためですから！強くなってこそ、より多くの人を助けられますから。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 75,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER",
      "CameraOffset": "DEFAULT",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "NR",
      "UnitMotion": "SAD",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그때도 제가 강했더라면… 사저의 맞수가 되었더라면…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あの時も、私がもっと強ければ…姉弟子の相手になれていたら…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 76,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "혼자 두지 않았을 텐데…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "一人にしたりしなかったのに…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 77,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "사저가 <color=#F7BE45>천문서</color>를 들고 달아나지도 않았을 텐데…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "姉弟子が<color=#F7BE45>天問書</color>を持って逃げることもなかったはずなのに…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 78,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "죄송합니다. 잠시 감상에 젖었군요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "すみません。少し感傷的になってしまいましたね。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 79,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER",
      "EmotionEffect": "THINK2",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…그립네요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…恋しいです。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 80,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "지금쯤 사저는 어디서 뭘 하고 계실까요…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "今頃、姉弟子はどこで何をしているのでしょうか…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 81,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "StartBgmFileName": "MUSIC_CUTSCENE_18.mp3",
      "StartFxSoundName": "SFX_CUTSCENE_COMMON_CHIME_BELL_02.mp3",
      "CutsceneClear": "CLEARUNIT",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그때, 딸랑거리는 종소리와 함께 누군가가 카페 안으로 들어왔다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "その時…カランカランとドアベルが鳴ると、誰かがカフェに入ってきた。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 82,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_SHOP_EMPLOYEE"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "어서… 아, 또 오셨네.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "いらっ…あぁ、また来ましたか。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 83,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_INDEPENDENT_VAGABOND",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "반갑다. 내 이름은 페이. 천문파를 대륙 널리 드높일 사람이지.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "妾の名はフェイ。天問派の名を大陸中に轟かせる者だ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 84,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_INDEPENDENT_VAGABOND",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "어떤가? 천문을 배워보지 않겠나?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "どうだ？天問を学んではみないか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 85,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_EASTERN_SWORDMASTER_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_SHOP_EMPLOYEE"
      ],
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "타운가드에 신고했으니까 금방 올 거예요. 가세요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "タウンガードに通報しましたから、すぐに来るはずですよ。さようなら。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
